# About Moon Fabrications
> Moon Fabrications makes MoonShade, a modular, all-weather portable vehicle awning designed to mount on almost any vehicle — vans, trucks, SUVs, Jeeps, trailers, buses, and RVs. Moon also makes MoonAnchors (mounting hardware), MoonSurface (a mounted table system), and branded apparel. Moon is a certified carbon-neutral company.

## MoonShade (Core Product Line)
- [MoonShade](https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade): The original awning, 9ft x 7ft of coverage, 8 lbs, for most vehicles with at least 9ft between anchor points.
- [MoonShade Sunset](https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade-sunset): Limited-edition color run of the original 9ft x 7ft MoonShade, same size and setup, sunset-inspired colorway.
- [MoonShade XL](https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade-xl): 12ft x 9ft coverage (100+ sq ft), 12.6 lbs, for vans, motorhomes, and larger vehicles needing more shade and a wider anchor span.
- [MoonShade PRO](https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade-pro): 9ft x 9ft coverage with modular zip-on walls for insect protection and privacy, 32 lbs with all three walls, for large vehicles with 9ft of mounting space.
- [MoonShade APEX](https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade-apex): 11ft x 7ft A-frame trailer awning with a single tension pole and legless design, built for Aliner and Rockwood hardside campers.
- [MoonShade RV](https://moonfab.com/products/moonshade-rv): 9ft x 7ft canopy that slides directly into a standard 3/8" Keder RV awning rail, no anchors required.
- [Shop All MoonShade](https://moonfab.com/collections/moonshade): Full MoonShade product lineup.
- [Which MoonShade Is Best for My Setup?](https://moonfab.com/pages/which-moonshade-is-right-for-me): Guided quiz that matches riders to the right MoonShade model based on their vehicle and needs.

